iaKamishiro", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kattebiki/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ee9e5ecf/uploads/origins/d4c6f5ac-b67d-44fc-9fed-39b8f782017e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d09beed5fee7e68f73c6f70d7368aff", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ee9e5ecf/uploads/origins/d4c6f5ac-b67d-44fc-9fed-39b8f782017e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d09beed5fee7e68f73c6f70d7368aff, https://si.imgix.net/ee9e5ecf/uploads/origins/d4c6f5ac-b67d-44fc-9fed-39b8f782017e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=911ab3a3b4d36d812d1b122c49db438c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ee9e5ecf/uploads/origins/d4c6f5ac-b67d-44fc-9fed-39b8f782017e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d055f6e021affc8776a6bd80b6c5e5f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "新規リクエスト失礼いたします。\n『アサルトリリィ Last Bullet』のヘルヴォルに所属する相澤一葉さんのイラストをご依頼いたします。\n服装は【マリンセーラーα】を希望いたします。\n何卒よろしくお願い申し上げます。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kattebiki/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ed9af218/uploads/origins/18983560-eb46-4c5c-9c35-e71a92088301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34ae13e7d8a0519da7887144c1acab71", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ed9af218/uploads/origins/18983560-eb46-4c5c-9c35-e71a92088301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34ae13e7d8a0519da7887144c1acab71, https://si.imgix.net/ed9af218/uploads/origins/18983560-eb46-4c5c-9c35-e71a92088301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=feba1f7d1716f9ddb9c2e6a13af82edb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ed9af218/uploads/origins/18983560-eb46-4c5c-9c35-e71a92088301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c66cbdff3fbe480d186b82b30b506fe 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "濁り茶さん\nはじめま